641|    : `***Innate Spellcasting.*** The ${name.toLowerCase()}'s innate spellcasting ability is ${data.ability} (spell save DC ${data.saveDC}). It can innately cast the following spells, requiring no material components:`;
642|
643|  lines.push(intro);
644|  lines.push(':');
645|
646|  // At will spells
